Q: CSS display none and opacity animation with keyframes not working A: <p>I just went the other direction - just flip it</p>
<pre class="lang-css prettyprint-override"><code>@keyframes slow-disappear {
  0% {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  50% {
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  99% {
    position:relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: fit-content;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  100% {
    position:absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    opacity: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
}
</code></pre>
